* {{i|Tech X|nr+}}
* {{i|Trisagion|nr+}}
Other interactions:
* {{i|Dr. Fetus|r}}: Bomb explosions have a chance of leaving the slowing creep in a larger pool than egg sack tears, however the egg sack bombs can't spawn [[Blue fly|Blue Flies]] / [[Blue spider|Blue Spiders]].
** {{i|Dr. Fetus|r+}} / {{i|Epic Fetus}}: Bombs can now spawn [[Blue fly|Blue Flies]] / [[Blue spider|Blue Spiders]].
* {{t|Fish Tail}}: The duplicated flies will spawn on top of the enemy and deal damage immediately.
* {{i|Haemolacria}}: Tears retain Haemolacria appearance and only the main tear can spawn flies or spiders when damaging enemies / {{dlc|r+}} smaller tears can now leave slowing creep and spawn flies and spiders.
* {{i|Ipecac|nr+}}: Only extra range applies on egg sack tears and they will not spawn flies or spiders.
* {{I|Montezuma's Revenge}}/{{i|Revelation|n}}: No effect.
* {{I|Spirit Sword}}: The sword projectiles can still spawn flies and spiders, but the swings themselves won't / {{dlc|r+}} the swings can now leave slowing creep and spawn flies and spiders.
* {{i|Tech.5|nr+}}/{{i|Technology 2}}: Lasers are unaffected.

