== Trivia ==
* Parasitoid is a term for when insects' larvae live inside their hosts as a parasite before eventually killing the host.
* {{dlc|r}} Parasitoid is one of the only five ({{dlc|r+}} six) items that count towards 2 transformations ({{tf|Beelzebub}} and {{tf|Spider Baby}}), the other ones being {{i|Magic Mushroom}}, {{i|The Bible}}, {{i|Hive Mind}}, {{I|Skatole}}, {{dlc|r+}} and {{i|The Necronomicon}}.

